          %h2#References References
          %p
            Despite its being frequently attributed to Ehresmann, the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+2-categories"} strict 2-categories
            is due to:
          %ul
            %li{:id => "Bénabou65"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                , Example (5) of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Catégories relatives
                %strong 260
                (1965) 3824-3827 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k4019v/f37.item"}> gallica
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (conceived as
                  = succeed "-" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+categories"} enriched categories
                  and called
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %em 2-categories
            %li#Maranda65
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean-Marie+Maranda"}> Jean-Marie Maranda
                , Def. 1 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Formal categories
                %strong 17
                (1965) 758-801 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4153/CJM-1965-076-0"}> doi:10.4153/CJM-1965-076-0
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.cambridge.org/core/services/aop-cambridge-core/content/view/A7C463460EB8CAC64C2CA340F870CF80/S0008414X00039729a.pdf/formal-categories.pdf"} pdf
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (conceived as
                  = succeed "-" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+categories"} enriched categories
                  and called
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %em categories of the second type
          %p
            both apparently following or inspired by the earlier definition of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+categories"} double categories
            due to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Ehresmann"}> Charles Ehresmann
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Catégories double et catégories structurées
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Ehresmann-CategoriesDoubles.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k3208j/f1246"} gallica
          %p
            An early definition also appears in the following, where it is mistakenly attributed to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Ehresmann"} Charles Ehresmann
          %ul
            %li#EK65
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Samuel+Eilenberg"}> Samuel Eilenberg
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G.+Max+Kelly"} G. Max Kelly
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Closed Categories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Samuel+Eilenberg"} S. Eilenberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D.+K.+Harrison"} D. K. Harrison
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S.+MacLane"} S. MacLane
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/H.+R%C3%B6hrl"} H. Röhrl
                (eds.):
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Proceedings+of+the+Conference+on+Categorical+Algebra+-+La+Jolla+1965"} Proceedings of the Conference on Categorical Algebra - La Jolla 1965
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-99902-4"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-99902-4
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (expressed entirely in components, under the name
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %em hypercategories
          %p
            The fundamental structure of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category+of+categories"} 2-category of categories
            (namely the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertical+composition"} vertical composition
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/horizontal+composition"} horizontal composition
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/whiskering"} whiskering
            of
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformations"} natural transformations
          %ul
            %li#Godement58
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Roger+Godement"}> Roger Godement
              , Appendix (pp. 269) of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topologie algébrique et theorie des faisceaux
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 1252
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.editions-hermann.fr/livre/topologie-algebrique-et-theorie-des-faisceaux-roger-godement"} webpage
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Godement-TopologieAlgebrique.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p Early discussion of the general notion of bicategories:
          %ul
            %li{:id => "Bénabou1967"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Introduction to Bicategories
              %strong 47
              Springer (1967) 1-77 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BFb0074299"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0074299
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Exposition and review:
          %ul
            %li#KellyStreet74
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Kelly"}> Max Kelly
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"} Ross Street
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Review of the elements of 2-categories
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G.+Max+Kelly"} G. Max Kelly
                (ed.) Lecture Notes in Mathematics
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 420
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0063101"} doi:10.1007/BFb0063101
            %li#Street96
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Categorical Structures
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S1570-7954(96)80019-2"} doi:10.1016/S1570-7954(96)80019-2
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://maths.mq.edu.au/~street/45.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Street-CategoricalStructures.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://shop.elsevier.com/books/handbook-of-algebra/hazewinkel/978-0-444-82212-3"} ISBN:978-0-444-82212-3
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                ,
                %em Encyclopedia article on 2-categories and bicategories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://www.maths.mq.edu.au/~street/Encyclopedia.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Leinster"}> Tom Leinster
                ,
                %em Basic bicategories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/9810017"}> arXiv:9810017
                )
            %li#Lack10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Lack"}> Steve Lack
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A 2-categories companion
                = succeed "." do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Towards+Higher+Categories"} Towards Higher Categories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math.CT/0702535"} arXiv:math.CT/0702535
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4419-1524-5_4"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4419-1524-5_4
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (including discussion of (
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+2-limits"}> strict
                  )
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-limits"} 2-limits
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Power"}> John Power
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em 2-Categories
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BRICS"} BRICS
                Notes Series (1998) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.brics.dk/NS/98/7/BRICS-NS-98-7.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Comprehensive textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ofer+Gabber"}> Ofer Gabber
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lorenzo+Ramero"} Lorenzo Ramero
                %em Foundations for almost ring theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0409584"}> arXiv:math/0409584
                )
            %li#JohnsonYau20
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Niles+Johnson"}> Niles Johnson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Donald+Yau"} Donald Yau
                = succeed "," do
                  %em 2-Dimensional Categories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/2002.06055"} arXiv:2002.06055
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://oxford.universitypressscholarship.com/view/10.1093/oso/9780198871378.001.0001/oso-9780198871378"} doi:10.1093/oso/9780198871378.001.0001
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coherence+theorems"} coherence theorems
          %ul
            %li#Power89
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+John+Power"}> A. John Power
              ,
              %em A general coherence result.
              J. Pure Appl. Algebra 57 (1989), no. 2, 165–173.
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0022-4049%2889%2990113-8"} doi:10.1016/0022-4049(89)90113-8
              %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=985657"} MR0985657
          %p Relation between bicategories and Tamsamani weak 2-categories:
          %ul
            %li#LackPaoli
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Lack"}> Steve Lack
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Simona+Paoli"} Simona Paoli
                %em 2-nerves for bicategories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0607271"}> arXiv
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Simona+Paoli"}> Simona Paoli
                ,
                %em From Tamsamani weak 2-categories to bicategories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://www.maths.mq.edu.au/~simonap/Bicategories_Rev_4.pdf"}> arXiv
                )
          %p
            There is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
            structure on 2-categories – the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/canonical+model+structure"} canonical model structure
            – that models the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%282%2C1%29-category"} (2,1)-category
            underlying
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2Cat"} 2Cat
          %ul
            %li#LackStrict
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Lack"}> Steve Lack
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Quillen Model Structure for 2-Categories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.usyd.edu.au/u/stevel/papers/qmc2cat.html"} website
            %li#LackFolkModel
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Lack"}> Steve Lack
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Quillen Model Structure for Biategories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.usyd.edu.au/u/stevel/papers/qmcbicat.html"} website
          %p
            Discussion of weak 2-categories in the style of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A-infinity+categories"} A-infinity categories
            is (using
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dendroidal+sets"} dendroidal sets
            to model the higher
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/operads"} operads
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Andor Lucacs,
                %em Dendroidal weak 2-categories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://de.arxiv.org/abs/1304.4278"}> arXiv:1304.4278
                )
            %li
              %p
                Jonathan Chiche,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em La théorie de l’homotopie des 2-catégories
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1411.6936"} arXiv
